# 📋 PactDa Smart Contract MVP Checklist (Sui/Move)

## 🎯 MVP Goal
Implement foundational Move smart contracts for PactDa protocol with **generalist and modular** architecture supporting pluggable resolution system. MVP focuses on core agreement logic with **ProgrammaticResolver** for Pioneer Developer Event (wagered games).

---

## ✅ Core Module Checklist

### 🔧 `pactda_core` Module - **PRIORITY 1**
#### Core Objects
- [x] **`PactDaContract` Object** - Central agreement object
  - [x] Fields: `id: UID`, `parties: vector<address>`, `status: u8`, `escrow_id: ID`, `resolution_policy_id: ID`
  - [x] Generic design for multiple use cases
  - [x] Event emission for state changes

- [x] **`Escrow` Object** - Secure SUI fund management
  - [x] Fields: `id: UID`, `contract_id: ID`, `balance: Balance<SUI>`
  - [x] Linked to specific PactDaContract
  - [x] Secure fund holding and release

#### Core Functions
- [x] **`create_agreement()`** - Agreement creation
  - [x] Parameters: `parties: vector<address>`, `resolution_policy_id: ID`
  - [x] Creates PactDaContract and associated Escrow
  - [x] Links objects together properly
  - [x] Emits `AgreementCreated` event

- [x] **`fund_escrow()`** - Stake deposit
  - [x] Parameters: `contract: &PactDaContract`, `escrow: &mut Escrow`, `payment: Coin<SUI>`
  - [x] Validates party authorization
  - [x] Deposits stake into escrow
  - [x] Emits `EscrowFunded` event

- [x] **`settle_agreement()`** - Final settlement
  - [x] Reads outcome from linked resolver
  - [x] Triggers escrow payout based on outcome
  - [x] Updates contract status
  - [x] Emits `AgreementSettled` event

