  - [x] Winner declaration capability

#### Core Functions
- [x] **`report_outcome()`** - Outcome reporting
  - [x] Parameters: `resolver: &mut Self`, `winner_address: address`, `ctx: &mut TxContext`
  - [x] **Security**: `assert!(tx_context::sender(ctx) == self.authority_address)`
  - [x] Sets outcome field to winner_address
  - [x] Emits `OutcomeReported` event

- [x] **Outcome Constants** - Predefined outcomes
  - [x] `outcome_party_a_wins()`
  - [x] `outcome_party_b_wins()`
  - [x] `outcome_draw()`

